body:
Child of the parallel-run-engine epic. Make validation runnable in parallel per item.

Scope: (1) every run gets its own worktree (validation_engine already creates validation/<run_id>) AND run-scoped
results - test output under test-framework/results/<run_id>/ (today shared); (2) PF's own checks must run in the
run's worktree, never the ROOT checkout (test_framework_integration/run_quality_gate take project_dir);
(3) per-item concurrency cap (max_parallel_assignments) so N validations run at once; (4) keep the brief store
lock only for the result write.

Out of scope: merge/push (C3).

Descriptors: module:core/validation_engine.py; module:core/test_framework_integration.py;
module:core/run_quality_gate.py; config:config/capacity.json;
test:test-framework/tests/pipeline/test_parallel_validation.py.
